   "text": "Malampuzha 岩石花园由世界知名艺术家 Padmashree Nekchand Saini 建造，他此前还设计了位于昌迪加尔的印度首座岩石花园。园中展出的所有作品均由花岗岩、石块、破碎的手镯、密胺餐盘、碎瓷砖等废旧材料制成，是一件非凡的创意与艺术杰作。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source sentence order is ambiguous about which garden was built first ('previously constructed the Malampuzha Rock Garden, designed India's first rock garden in Chandigarh'); translated to keep both facts without adding chronology. Please verify source wording."
